00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:36.930
Shake this world, and all be blown away!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.640
With one blast, no enemies remain.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:40.230
Flowers bloom, butterflies dance,

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:41.240
Grandpa's rheu—
